ros-rolling-off-highway-general-purpose-radar (1.4.0-1resolute) resolute; urgency=high

  * Fix node termination without error log by adding try/catchUncaught exceptions from malformed/manipulated CAN frames in callback_can() previously caused the node to terminate silently. This adds a try/catch block to handle the error gracefully, write to the error log, and keep the node running.
    
    Tests were updated to reflect this change.
  * Contributors: Darius Man

